  "2026-07-27T07:35:37.945Z","harness:codex","Start evidence 2026-07-27: selected after live all-status review of 2,129 items (1,807 closed, 309 open, 13 canceled; zero pre-existing in-progress), full canonical metadata/closed-lineage review, and GitHub/security/dependency inventory. This item is actively implemented in one cohesive public SDK/CLI integrity PR; unrelated backlog and container epics remain open and unclaimed."
  "2026-07-27T08:17:32.479Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: clone-local item merge drivers now leave Git's %P placeholder unquoted so Git performs exactly one shell-quoting pass; receipt ingestion normalizes one legacy single- or double-quote pair. Unit and end-to-end merge safety regressions cover bare, single-quoted, and double-quoted paths. Full sandboxed coverage passed 377 files and 6,452 tests at exact 100/100/100/100."
